{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": [\"S08-1\"],\n      \"beads\": [\"B1.1\", \"B1.2\"],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"缓慢而宽广的歌唱重新浮现，熟悉的沉思与近乎祈求的柔软也再次打开；怅惘稍歇后，他终于能温柔地看着那份真切的失落。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [\"S08-2\"],\n      \"beads\": [\"B2.1\", \"B2.2\"],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"这份安静刚被认出就又退开，像即将离去的人最后回望一眼；那份温柔并没有消失，却已成为带着不舍的告别，缓和也因此显出转瞬即逝的性质。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [\"S08-2\"],\n      \"beads\": [\"B3.1\", \"B3.2\"],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"激烈思绪之间确实出现了一口短暂的喘息，但它只能让他暂时透气，无法真正安顿内心；余波仍在牵动着他，平静并未真正到来。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"explains\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"beads\": [\"B1\"],\n      \"why\": \"B1中的缓慢宽广歌唱与熟悉的沉思、祈求气息重新出现，正对应怅惘渐歇后重新获得的柔和观看姿态，使失落不再只是令人难以承受的情绪，而成为可以温柔凝视的真实感受。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"beads\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"],\n      \"why\": \"B2写出安静刚刚显现便退去，以及离开前温柔而不舍的回望；B3则将这种短暂缓和进一步写成激烈思绪间的一次喘息，却明确指出喘息并不等于重新安顿。两组感受共同说明，眼前的柔和只是短暂间歇，先前的余波仍未平息。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": []\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "41efc58c-0cc8-4176-9553-4aab787747b6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T114134587147Z", "elapsed_seconds": 30.547, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T11:42:05.128526+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "03040a02ce55a05e55138d45c72f10a0774a53a0794be3a70210baa87df7bcd4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth